# Employer-board candidates for scripts/board-seeds/validate.mjs (MKT-4S).
# Every line is a GUESS: "this employer hosts its careers on this job-board system under this board id".
# A line here is not a fact and puts nothing into a seed file. Only the answer of the live board does
# (report-<date>.json, "valid": true). See README.md in this directory.
# "aliases": another spelling of the employer's name as its board may state it (Greenhouse, SmartRecruiters), or the
# board id where the system states no company name (Lever, Ashby) and the id does not spell the name.
# "aliasSource" (lever, ashby): the document of this repository that confirms such a board id for the employer. Only
# with it does the board carry the employer's name. Without it a board that answers is seeded under its board id
# ("board_id_only" in the report): the line still records whose board the author believes it is, nothing more.
# "countries" (smartrecruiters only): ask with the API's country filter.
# greenhouse
